hpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"F9OFNrITmQ1a9glscJ20ag","review_id":"pMwQbdlevH-GqbQoxhPUGQ","date":"2011-03-10T17:54:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.958248496055603,"text_excerpt":"Cowbell is delicious. My sister was so adamant about their having the best burgers in the city, everyone at the table ordered burgers. Some info: they grind the meat there, everything is ridiculously fresh, and the owners/staff are super-friendly and serious about what they're doing. The adult grilled cheese (which changes regularly) was freaking awesome. It had duck and carmelized onions, if my memory serves me correctly. They have nightly specials, and I ordered the lamb burger. I also tried a salad with beets and brie croutons that was stellar. Overall, Cowbell was a great dining experience--from the service to the decor to, most importantly, the food--and I can't wait to try the mac a..."},{"business_id":"F9OFNrITmQ1a9glscJ20ag","review_id":"Cc7vg-4yk0LflPfMYJ84RA","date":"2018-02-20T16:53:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9547094106674194,"text_excerpt":"Cowbell is so good! We started coming here for their burgers with the agogo sauce, so yum!! We then started branching out and trying other things on the menu and they have all been so tasty. The brussel sprouts are our go to for an appetizer. I don't know if I have ever enjoyed vegetables more than that dish. The grapes and almonds in there go so perfectly. The burger of course is very good, add cheese, add bacon and onion compote (sooo tasty). The grilled gulf fish tacos are really good if you're looking for something on the lighter side. Everything is seasoned perfectly for a good bite every time. The midnight skirt steak is also very good. I've never had anything here that I did not li..."},{"business_id":"F9OFNrITmQ1a9glscJ20ag","review_id":"m3NSEIGgb6ONipOwmP9V9Q","date":"2011-03-26T19:44:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9431660771369934,"text_excerpt":"Cowbell came highly recommended by someone, so I followed up. BOY am I glad I did, and I WILL be back. I started with a hamburger that was so succulent and tasty. It was a definite \"melt in your mouth\" experience. As I left, I noticed my referral with the juiciest looking Ribeye with a stack of onion rings on her plate! As much as I enjoyed the burger, I became jealous of this woman's steak. She even let me taste an onion ring that was the bomb, and I'm a huge fan of onion rings! The decor is very cool, and, best of all, the lighting in the place is awesome. I also loved being in a place where the clientele seemed like a restaurant full of really happy people. I think a part of that is al..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"F9OFNrITmQ1a9glscJ20ag","photo_id":"W0cZcLctikBj4v-59iI0zg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/W0cZcLctikBj4v-59iI0zg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9212305545806885},{"business_id":"F9OFNrITmQ1a9glscJ20ag","photo_id":"YtOAd7nM5gGAFvaAtXedmw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YtOA